The symbol detector (data/detector.onnx) and the shape classifier's samples
(data/glyph-train.tsv) were trained on generated music engraved with the Emmentaler, Leland,
MuseJazz, Bravura, Petaluma, Finale Maestro, Finale Broadway and Gonville fonts, with some TAB
numbers in fonts that come with Windows. The detector also learnt from public-domain scans of
songs whose notes are CC0 (data/dev/lieder). No font file is included. The fonts' licenses are
listed in extension/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md.